        "sid": "GEN 50"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "50",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Josefu ukamghuya ndee wushunyi, ukamsusugha ukilila na ndighi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawilaghira waghanga wighuboise mumbi ghwa ndee kwa maghanga ghusakewoa. Na waghanga wikaghuboisa mumbi ghwa Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nagho ghoredwaeghe matuku mirongo ina ghukiboiswa, angu nigho gherekundikieghe kwa kuibonya iyo kazi. Wamisri wikamlilia Israeli matuku mirongo mfungade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji agho matuku gha kulila gherekateghe, Josefu ukaghora na wandu wa nyumba ya mzuri ukighamba, “Ngera narumirikia mesonyi konyu, namlomba mumghorie mzuri huwu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba orenighemeshereghe ukighamba, ‘Ini neko kaavui na kufwa; kunirike kaburinyi kwapo iyo nereikotereghe isanga ja Kanaani.’ Kwa huwu nakulomba kunisighe nighende nimrike aba, ima niwuye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.47.29+GEN.47.30+GEN.47.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 47.29-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukamtumbulia ukighamba, “Ghenda kumrike ndeyo sa iji koni orekughemeshereghe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Josefu ukaghenda kumrika ndee, na wadumiki wa mzuri wose wikafuma wikaghendanya na Josefu, na wabaa wose wa nyumba ya mzuri, na wabaa wose wa isanga ja Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni na nyumba yose ya Josefu, waruna wose na kinyumba chose cha ndee, wikaghendanya nao. Wandu weresigharikieghe Gosheni ni wana watini, andwamweri na ng'ondi, mburi, na ng'ombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikadwa magare na farasi wori. Werekoghe wandu wengi na ndighi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji werevikieghe lwala loelia viro lwa Atadi, luko kimonu cha Jordani, wikalila kililo kibaa cha wasi, na Josefu ukabonya ifwa aho kwa wundu ghwa ndee matuku mfungade. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji wandu wa ijo isanga ja Kanaani werewonieghe icho kililo, na ijo ifwa jerebonyeroghe aho Atadi lwala loelia viro wikaghamba, “Ichi kililo cha Wamisri ni kibaa na ndighi!” Kwa huwu andu aho kukawangwa Abel-misraimu, kuko kimonu cha Jordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko huwu wana wa Israeli wikabonya sa iji koni werelaghiriloghe ni ndee; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu wana wake weremdwaeghe hata isanga ja Kanaani, wikamrika andenyi ya mbanga, mbuwenyi Makpela, iko mashariki ya Mamre, iyo Abrahamu oreighueghe chiaimweri na mbuwa yaro kufuma kwa Efroni Mhiti, ipate kukaia andu korikia wandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 7.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao nyuma ya kumrika ndee, Josefu chiaimweri na waruna na wose wereghendanyeghe marikonyi gha ndee wikawuya cha Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaghiro gha Josefu kwa waruna",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya kifwa cha ndee, waruna Josefu wikaghamba, “Wele ikaia wada ikakaia Josefu uduagha na luwawo ngolonyi, kwa wundu ghwa iro maza rizamie derem'bonyereghe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo wikaduma momu kwa Josefu wikighamba, “Ndeyo oredinekieghe momu imbiri usefue ukadizera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Mumzere Josefu angu namlomba umfuye wughoma kwa wundu ghwa ugho wuwiwi ghose morem'bonyereghe.’ Na idana dakulomba kudifuye wughoma ugho wuwiwi dikubonyere isi wadumiki wa Mlungu wa ndeyo.” Josefu uendasikira huwo ukalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na awo waruna wikacha na kughoghoma hata andonyi imbiri kwake wikighamba, “Ola isi deko wadumiki wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Josefu ukawizera, “Msakeobua, angu ini siko wulalo ghwa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo loli morekoghe na njama enibonya kiwiwi, ela Mlungu oreibonyereghe njama iyo irede mecha gha kukira marangi gha wengi sa iji yawuyakaia idime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwu msakeobua; nichamneka kula kilambo, inyo na wana wenyu wori.” Huwo ukawikumba ngolo na kuwihoresha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kifwa cha Josefu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu ukakaia Misri na kinyumba chose cha ndee, ukakaia moyo miaka ighana na ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu ukawiwona wana wa Efraimu hata kivalwa cha kadadu; na wana wa Makiri mwana wa Manase werevaloghe mangonyi kwa Josefu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Josefu ukawizera waruna, “Ini neko kaavui na kufwa, ela Mlungu uchamchea na kumfunya isanga iji, umghenje jija isanga oremghenjereghe Abrahamu, Isaaka na Jakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu ukawighemesha wana wa Israeli ukighamba, “Iji Mlungu wamchea na kumfunya isanga iji, mchaghidwa maindi ghapo wori ghifume isanga iji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
